## Starting the Raid

When you load in, a Chalice of Light and a bridge-building plate are directly in front of you. Pick up the Chalice, let it charge, and pass it around the group — each player getting Enlightened dumps their buff into the plate to build the bridge faster. Once the bridge is fully formed, enemies despawn and you cross into the raid.

